    <h1>Whale season: a possible sighting</h1>
    <p class="lead" style="margin-top:var(--space-4)">During certain months of the year it's possible to spot whales during the voyage to the Palomino Islands.</p>
    <p style="margin-top:var(--space-4)">Unlike sea lions and birds — which are guaranteed on every departure — whale sightings depend on the season and sea conditions, so we cannot guarantee them.</p>
